  "description": "Two trials at a controlled podium top and after one full200tick breath show natural entry into scanning, rather than an immediate roar, with a creative observer. No landing flight or four-breath-limit claim. All summoned dragons are persistent to isolate scanning from the existing random-despawn path.",
